@host = http://localhost:5226

### 1. Simple question
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is FOIR?"
}

### 2. Chat with history
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "My monthly salary is ₹80,000." },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Noted. Your monthly salary is ₹80,000." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "My EMIs are ₹30,000. What is my FOIR?" }
  ]
}

### 3. Empty question (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}

### 4. Strong applicant (expect Low risk)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/assess
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Sharma",
  "monthlyIncome": 120000,
  "existingEmis": 10000,
  "requestedLoanAmount": 500000,
  "tenureMonths": 36,
  "annualInterestRate": 12,
  "cibilScore": 790,
  "employmentType": "Salaried",
  "yearsInCurrentJob": 5
}

### 5. Risky applicant (expect High risk)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/assess
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arun Kumar",
  "monthlyIncome": 45000,
  "existingEmis": 18000,
  "requestedLoanAmount": 400000,
  "tenureMonths": 24,
  "annualInterestRate": 14,
  "cibilScore": 640,
  "employmentType": "Self-employed",
  "yearsInCurrentJob": 1
}

### 6. Agent: full affordability check (expect 3 tools)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can the applicant with PAN ABCDE1234F afford a ₹5,00,000 loan for 36 months at 12%? Include her existing EMIs."
}

### 7. Agent: EMI only (expect only CalculateEmi)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the EMI for ₹10,00,000 at 10.5% for 60 months?"
}

### 8. Agent: unknown PAN (expect 'not found', no made-up data)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Check loan eligibility for PAN ZZZZZ9999Z."
}

### 9. What does an embedding look like?
GET {{host}}/api/ai/embed?text=FOIR limit for personal loans

### 10. Semantic search: "freelancer" finds the self-employed rules
GET {{host}}/api/ai/policy/search?q=Can a freelancer get a personal loan?

### 11. Semantic search: no shared keywords with the "bounces" rule
GET {{host}}/api/ai/policy/search?q=My customer missed a few EMI payments recently

### 12. Semantic search: top 1 only
GET {{host}}/api/ai/policy/search?q=How much money can I borrow?&top=1